{"text": "skillful", "etymologies": [{"etymologyHTML": "<p>From Middle English <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">skilful</i>, <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"enm\">skylfull</i>, <i class=\"None mention\" lang=\"snm\">scelvol</i>, equivalent to <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">skill</i> +\u200e <i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\">-ful</i>.\n</p>", "pos": [{"pos": "Adjective", "definitions": [{"definition": "Possessing skill; skilled.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}, {"definition": "Requiring skill.\n", "quote": [], "relative": {}}]}]}], "pronunciation": [["IPA", "/\u02c8sk\u026al.f\u0259l/"]]}